Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 13:14:15 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Size the V8 warning-policy analysis test as small

Native macOS job 117012089706 warns that this 0.1-second analysis check falls outside the MODERATE range. Keep its assertions and use the small-test timeout. Focused verification passes with --test_verbose_timeout_warnings and produces no timing advisory (v8-policy-size-green.log).
---
 tools/build-warnings/dependencies/BUILD.bazel | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/tools/build-warnings/dependencies/BUILD.bazel b/tools/build-warnings/dependencies/BUILD.bazel
index a7ddb4a3b..437d6791e 100644
--- a/tools/build-warnings/dependencies/BUILD.bazel
+++ b/tools/build-warnings/dependencies/BUILD.bazel
@@ -2,5 +2,6 @@ load(":flags_test.bzl", "dependency_warning_flags_test")
 
 dependency_warning_flags_test(
     name = "v8_warning_policy_test",
+    size = "small",
     target_under_test = "@v8//:core_lib_icu",
 )
